[TITLE]
NUM-46: closed storage pond (10000 ft2, initial depth 0.02 ft = 200 ft3,
P1 100 mg/L = 1.248 lb) dries out by evaporation (1 in/day, about 5.8 h).
The outlet sits 6 ft above the bottom, so nothing leaves: all of the
pollutant must end up in Final Stored Mass, once.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             12:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         10
VARIABLE_STEP        0
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT  1.0
DRY_ONLY  NO

[JUNCTIONS]
J2   0   5   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   0   FREE

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth Shape a b c SurDepth Fevap
SU1  0  10  0.02  FUNCTIONAL  0  0  10000  0  1

[CONDUITS]
C1  SU1  J2  400  0.013  6  0  0
C2  J2   O1  400  0.013  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1  0  0  0  1
C2  CIRCULAR  1  0  0  0  1

[POLLUTANTS]
P1  MG/L  0  0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  100

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
